  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FGM 2020-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reduce cases of FGM and CEFM and increse women&apos;s social and economic empowerment through interventions at individual, household, community and societal levels.

The intended impact is to contribute towards greater voice, choice and control and strengthened gender equality and empowerment for Somali women and girls.</narrative>
  </description>
